,title,link,text,language,family
0,Semaq Beri language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semaq_Beri_language,"Semaq Beri (Semoq Beri) is an Austroasiatic language spoken in the Malay Peninsula in the states of Pahang and Terengganu. It belongs to the Southern division of the Aslian languages, along with Semelai, Temoq, and Mah Meri.",Semaq Beri,Austro-Asiatic
1,Semaq Beri people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semaq_Beri_people,"The Semaq Beri language is a language spoken by the people, is an Austroasiatic language that belongs to the Southern grouping of the branch of Aslian languages.",Semaq Beri,Austro-Asiatic
